{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1063acf-f3df-8d4b-b6b4-34956accbbb5",
  "created_at": "2026-02-08T10:09:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Andres Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning Lorraine. Sorry, I know it's Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I figured this was the number to try. I've got you on speakerphone, my hands are full of coffee. [pause] Anyway, it's like ten degrees out, I looked at the thermometer on the porch and it nearly made me go back to bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been a cold one, that's for sure. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So we got that dusting of snow overnight, nothing big, but it's on top of what's still sitting there from the storm. And the street hasn't been plowed since then. Not once. I'm calling for my mother, she's sitting right here next to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hi to your mom. And what street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:06:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Malbone Road. Four fifty-five Malbone Road, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four fifty-five Malbone Road. Let me make sure I have that right, four five five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, four five five. And it's all packed down and icy now from the cold, so it's like a skating rink out front. She's got to get to the car for church later and I don't love that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So the street hasn't been plowed since the storm, and now it's icy with a light layer of new snow on top. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, exactly. And what I was hoping is, can we get some sand? Even just a little bit at the end of the driveway and out on the road by the curb. Whatever you guys can do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for sanding at that address. Are you looking for the street itself, or sand you can spread yourselves on the walkway and driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, Ma, she's asking. [pause] Both, honestly. The street would be great, but if there's a place we can pick up a bucket for the driveway, I'd take that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note both. I'll put the street down for plowing and sanding, and I'll mention that you'd like sand for the driveway. I can't tell you exactly when a crew will get there, but it goes to the crew supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I just want it on their list. Do you need a number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. What's a good callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0168. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0168. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Andres Figueroa. F-I-G-U-E-R-O-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Figueroa. So that's 455 Malbone Road, street not plowed since the storm, icy with a dusting on top, request plowing and sanding, and sand for the driveway if possible. Your mother is the resident there, and you're calling on her behalf."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that's all of it. You're good at this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. If it gets worse before anyone arrives, you can call this line back, it's staffed through the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:09:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. Thank you, Lorraine. Say thanks, Ma. She says thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Tell her to stay off the ice and keep warm. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T10:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
